  "order.4": "<k id=\"limit\">LIMIT</k> keeps the first few rows and drops the rest. Top three, done.",
  "order.5": "Without ORDER BY, LIMIT three means any three rows. Always sort before you cut.",
  "recent.1": "The bakery wants its three most recent orders, newest first. Just the ID and the date.",
  "recent.ask": "Write the whole query this time.",
